A scale with the SID: voice 1, triangle, PAL frequencies.
C64 BASIC V2, from BASICv2Quick.guide, example 5.

10 S=54272
20 FOR I=0 TO 24 : POKE S+I,0 : NEXT I
30 POKE S+24,15 : REM VOLUME
40 POKE S+5,9 : POKE S+6,0 : REM ENVELOPE
50 FOR N=1 TO 8
60 READ H,L
70 POKE S+1,H : POKE S,L
80 POKE S+4,17 : REM TRIANGLE, GATE ON
90 FOR D=1 TO 200 : NEXT D
100 POKE S+4,16 : REM GATE OFF
110 NEXT N
120 DATA 17,103,19,137,21,237,23,59
130 DATA 26,19,29,69,32,218,34,206
